cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PRSGuard, please cite it as below."
title: "PRSGuard: a trait-first, evidence-aware polygenic score router and applicability gate"
abstract: >-
  A trait-first, evidence-aware PGS router that decides not only which polygenic score can be
  calculated, but whether its interpretation is supported for the individual. Research software /
  prototype; not a medical device.
type: software
authors:
